doc:FactsarticleDifferentiallyPrivateFederatedLearningForRul schema1:abstract "Accurate remaining useful life (RUL) prediction is essential for the safe and cost-effective operation of safety-critical systems. This paper presents a privacy-preserving DP-enhanced FL setup for RUL prediction that combines federated learning with differential privacy, describes an end-to-end implementation based on the Opacus DP library, and analyses results on CMAPSS and SiC MOSFET datasets." .
_:e27ec7a37b21792b4d9f7bec0a270ebc rdf:reifies <<( doc:FactsarticleDifferentiallyPrivateFederatedLearningForRul schema1:abstract "Accurate remaining useful life (RUL) prediction is essential for the safe and cost-effective operation of safety-critical systems. This paper presents a privacy-preserving DP-enhanced FL setup for RUL prediction that combines federated learning with differential privacy, describes an end-to-end implementation based on the Opacus DP library, and analyses results on CMAPSS and SiC MOSFET datasets." )>> ;
